   "subject": "SEM with composite variable and survey design",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\n\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\">Dear all,</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\n\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\"> </span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\n\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\">I am encountering some problems when\nevaluating a model that includes a composite variable and to which I added\nreplicate weights (because my data points do not have an equal accuracy).</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\n\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\"> </span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\n\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\">My model includes a quadratic and\nlinear effect of rainfall on some endogenous variables. To test the combined\neffect of rainfall on the other variables, I want to add a composite variable.</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\n\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\">The model <u>without</u> composite\nvariable looks like this:</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\n\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\"> </span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\n\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,112,192);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\">modeldiam &lt;- &#39;<br>\nSqrt.AGB_Ch_10cm ~ SP50stem_10cm + diam_mean_10cm + T_CEC_SOIL + Prec.m +\nPrec.m.squared<br>\nSP50stem_10cm ~ T_CEC_SOIL + Prec.m  + Prec.m.squared<br>\ndiam_mean_10cm ~ T_CEC_SOIL +  Prec.m<br>\n&#39;<br>\nfitdiam &lt;- sem(modeldiam, estimator=&quot;ML&quot;, fixed.x=T,\ndata=averdata.all.unique)</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\n\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,112,192);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\">survey.design &lt;- svydesign (id=~1,\n, weights = ~Weight, data=averdata.all.unique) # This is including replicate\nweights<br>\nfit.totaldiam &lt;- lavaan.survey(lavaan.fit=fitdiam,\nsurvey.design=survey.design, estimator = &quot;MLM&quot;)  # This\nevaluates the model taking into account the replicate weights<br>\nsummary(fit.totaldiam, standardized=T, fit.measures=T)  </span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\n\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\"> </span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\n\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\">This model works well.</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\n\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\"> </span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\n\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\">Then, when <u>adding a composite\nvariable</u> for the combined effect of rainfall, the model looks like this:</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\n\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\"> </span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\n\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,112,192);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\">modelcomposite1 &lt;- &#39;<br>\nRainfall &lt;~ 10.314*Prec.m + Prec.m.squared<br>\nSqrt.AGB_Ch_10cm ~ Rainfall + T_CEC_SOIL + SP50stem_10cm + diam_mean_10cm<br>\nSP50stem_10cm ~ T_CEC_SOIL + Rainfall<br>\ndiam_mean_10cm ~ T_CEC_SOIL + Prec.m<br>\n&#39;</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\n\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,112,192);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\">fitcomposite &lt;-\nsem(modelcomposite1, <a href=\"http://std.lv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://std.lv&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792431642038000&amp;usg=AOvVaw08vxk1uQvvsuLy83oWiDkN\">std.lv</a>=T, data=averdata.all.unique)</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\n\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\"> </span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\n\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\">Until here, it works fine as well.\nBut when including the replicate weights, the problem starts:</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\n\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,112,192);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\">fit.totalcomposite &lt;-\nlavaan.survey(lavaan.fit=fitcomposite, survey.design=survey.design, estimator =\n&quot;MLM&quot;)  </span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\n\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\"> </span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\n\n</font><p style=\"background-position:0% 0%;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline;background-image:none;background-repeat:repeat;background-size:auto;background-origin:padding-box;background-clip:border-box\"><span style=\"background:rgb(225,226,229);color:rgb(197,6,11);font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Warning message:</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\n\n</font><p style=\"background-position:0% 0%;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline;background-image:none;background-repeat:repeat;background-size:auto;background-origin:padding-box;background-clip:border-box\"><span style=\"background-position:0% 0%;color:rgb(197,6,11);font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt;background-image:none;background-repeat:repeat;background-size:auto;background-origin:padding-box;background-clip:border-box\"><font style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">In lavaan::lavaan(model = modelcomposite1, model.type = &quot;sem&quot;,\nint.ov.free = TRUE,<span>  </span>:</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\n\n</font><p style=\"background-position:0% 0%;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline;background-image:none;background-repeat:repeat;background-size:auto;background-origin:padding-box;background-clip:border-box\"><span style=\"background-position:0% 0%;color:rgb(197,6,11);font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt;background-image:none;background-repeat:repeat;background-size:auto;background-origin:padding-box;background-clip:border-box\"><font style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span>  </span>lavaan WARNING: model has NOT\nconverged!</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\n\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\"> </span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\n\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 3pt;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\">Even when I try to reduce the model (e.g., take out 1 or 2 variables or\npaths), the problem remains. Does anyone know why this could be the case??</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\n\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 3pt;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\"> </span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\n\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 3pt;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\">I would be grateful for any help!</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\n\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 3pt;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\"> </span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\n\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 3pt;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\">Regards,<br>\nMasha</span></p></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
